{"concept":"necessity","groups":[{"id":"need","name":{"ru":"Нужда, потребность и бедствие","en":"Need, requirement and distress"},"count":31},{"id":"necessity","name":{"ru":"Необходимость","en":"Necessity"},"count":10},{"id":"cry-of-need","name":{"ru":"Крик нужды","en":"Cry of need"},"count":14}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ff639bab5bd37a718038c52c25fafd4c","tos.text-unit.sid-ff639bab5bd37a718038c52c25fafd4c"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"sleep-sage","addressee":"young-listeners","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["agency","sleep-sage"],"line":{"ru":"Мудрец сна требует бодрствующей подготовки ко сну.","en":"The sleep sage demands wakeful preparation for sleep."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5998797d8fd3fb0dece8850212905ee9","tos.text-unit.sid-5998797d8fd3fb0dece8850212905ee9"]},"form":"nöthig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"need","neighbours":["body-self","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Тело ставит вопрос о назначении лучшей мудрости.","en":"The body raises the question of the purpose of one’s best wisdom."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-291b4d8252630131ed299e2e2d899f5e","tos.text-unit.sid-291b4d8252630131ed299e2e2d899f5e"]},"form":"Nothdurft","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["will","earth","zarathustra","imagined-brother"],"line":{"ru":"Собственная добродетель говорит земным благом поверх готовых законов.","en":"One’s own virtue speaks an earthly good beyond established laws."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fb7d674b5a709c0d22716da16915369a","tos.text-unit.sid-fb7d674b5a709c0d22716da16915369a"]},"form":"nothwendig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["fate","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Вражда добродетелей получает имя необходимого зла.","en":"The virtues’ hostility receives the name of necessary evil."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b928916c29c8820604e6c175bb9042c8","tos.text-unit.sid-b928916c29c8820604e6c175bb9042c8"]},"form":"noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["agency","zarathustra","death-preachers"],"line":{"ru":"Сострадание произносится как способ слабее держаться жизни.","en":"Compassion is spoken as a way of loosening one’s hold on life."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d90706f3da9a436c547c9e98284964a1","tos.text-unit.sid-d90706f3da9a436c547c9e98284964a1"]},"form":"Nothwendigen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["fate","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"За пределами государства начинается единственная песнь необходимого человека.","en":"Beyond the state begins the necessary person’s unique song."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d01c774fead6beca92699b82c0a8483c","tos.text-unit.sid-d01c774fead6beca92699b82c0a8483c"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Избавление от высшей нужды возвышается до священного.","en":"Release from the greatest need is elevated to the sacred."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9ad4edbfc68f464c6abd6f1618e48adc","tos.text-unit.sid-6de0df5144142c3078578d035f066f5a"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["difference","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Условия жизни народа раскрывают его закон преодолений.","en":"A people’s conditions of life reveal its law of overcoming."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4b8e5e9e3dda25abb833c346358bef69","tos.text-unit.sid-4b8e5e9e3dda25abb833c346358bef69"]},"form":"Nothdurft","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"marriage-questioner","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"need","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель спрашивает, что говорит в желании брака.","en":"The teacher asks what speaks in the desire for marriage."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4d619a94ef7199cfd4aaf7202d99a625","tos.text-unit.sid-4d619a94ef7199cfd4aaf7202d99a625"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"marriage-questioner","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["becoming","agency","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Желание служанки оборачивается собственной зависимостью.","en":"The desire for a servant turns into one’s own dependence."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2c810b780dd774ba2430062b27733b27","tos.text-unit.sid-2c810b780dd774ba2430062b27733b27"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["fate","will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Единство воления даёт нужде имя необходимости.","en":"Unified willing gives need the name necessity."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-dd4549d204c95af0458c76a477cfa443","tos.text-unit.sid-dd4549d204c95af0458c76a477cfa443"]},"form":"noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["becoming","identity","creation","agency","redemption","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Творение облегчает жизнь через боль и превращение.","en":"Creation lightens life through pain and transformation."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f1ad6ce0aa27ac51824faadb59b07ce6","tos.text-unit.sid-f1ad6ce0aa27ac51824faadb59b07ce6"]},"form":"nothwendig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["fate","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Требование необходимой добродетели раскрывается верой в полицию.","en":"Demanding necessary virtue unfolds as belief in police."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4df2043af452d730da92e94e93b7c89a","tos.text-unit.sid-4df2043af452d730da92e94e93b7c89a"]},"form":"nöthig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["identity","bite","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Жизненная нужда во вражде становится тяжёлым куском знания.","en":"Life’s need for hostility becomes a hard morsel of knowledge."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-be8a5cff971d842a4d2590fe488f0b8f","tos.text-unit.sid-be8a5cff971d842a4d2590fe488f0b8f"]},"form":"nöthig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"need","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель спрашивает о жизненной необходимости черни.","en":"The teacher asks about life’s need for the rabble."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-21028b81bd477ae92cfed4655f20506c","tos.text-unit.sid-21028b81bd477ae92cfed4655f20506c"]},"form":"nöthig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"need","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель спрашивает, нужны ли жизни отравленные источники.","en":"The teacher asks whether life needs poisoned springs."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.22","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ee6bd9bc9cfd8925ebd83067ae97940c","tos.text-unit.sid-ee6bd9bc9cfd8925ebd83067ae97940c"]},"form":"nöthigsten","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"dream","use":"question","group":"need","neighbours":["agency","zarathustra","quietest-hour"],"line":{"ru":"Повелевающий великим назван самым необходимым.","en":"The one commanding great things is named the most needed."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6df9d7f3ac0584efe7a82d11afcb1a26","tos.text-unit.sid-6df9d7f3ac0584efe7a82d11afcb1a26"]},"form":"nöthig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["agency","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Восходящему нужно научиться смотреть за пределы себя.","en":"The climber must learn to look beyond themselves."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.04","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c12d9e3f8a399bafd729cdc6b3672515","tos.text-unit.sid-c12d9e3f8a399bafd729cdc6b3672515"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Странствие и восхождение уступают высшему желанию полёта.","en":"Wandering and ascent yield to the higher desire of flight."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2ab28e36d239473986dac7805cd84093","tos.text-unit.sid-2ab28e36d239473986dac7805cd84093"]},"form":"nöthig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["bite","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Малые добродетели вызывают вопрос о необходимости малых людей.","en":"Small virtues raise the question of small people’s necessity."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5389572ee4c7547c94166778ae39d3c2","tos.text-unit.sid-33bb3ba18516502e929fef3ea5158354"]},"form":"Nöthe","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"need","neighbours":["body-self","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Зимняя нужда прикрывает счастье от завистливого сострадания.","en":"Winter need shelters happiness from envious compassion."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fb23cb044b07bb7f12da7e5f29161308","tos.text-unit.sid-fb23cb044b07bb7f12da7e5f29161308"]},"form":"Notwendigkeit","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["fate","present","identity","gateway","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Время открывается опытом свободы самой необходимости.","en":"Time opens through an experience of necessity itself as freedom."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c07c145f5ba897c832454e223f1d4667","tos.text-unit.sid-c07c145f5ba897c832454e223f1d4667"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["will","creation","spirit-of-gravity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель перечисляет тяжёлые создания своего противника.","en":"The teacher lists his opponent’s weighty creations."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bde100d4594f5f1039e696cc0e21a8e5","tos.text-unit.sid-bde100d4594f5f1039e696cc0e21a8e5"]},"form":"nothwendigste","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["fate","joy-lust","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Необходимейшая душа радостно бросается в случай.","en":"The most necessary soul plunges joyfully into chance."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e3821f38fac71f7038b4a95e7d6c4553","tos.text-unit.sid-e3821f38fac71f7038b4a95e7d6c4553"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"will","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["fate","will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Воля названа собственной необходимостью и поворотом нужды.","en":"Will is named one’s necessity and the turning of need."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-caea8bc50f96e7c3ac65756f152479d2","tos.text-unit.sid-caea8bc50f96e7c3ac65756f152479d2"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"will","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["fate","will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Воля должна сохранить силы для одной большой победы.","en":"Will is to preserve strength for one great victory."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7174d0582726c8e4639d0814b0bb0327","tos.text-unit.sid-7174d0582726c8e4639d0814b0bb0327"]},"form":"nöthig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"animals","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["will","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель связывает лучшее человека с необходимостью его худшего.","en":"The teacher joins the human’s best to the need for its worst."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1648b969311bd080ea1fb2577f23d573","tos.text-unit.sid-1648b969311bd080ea1fb2577f23d573"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra-soul","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["fate","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Освобождённая душа получает имена поворота нужды и судьбы.","en":"The freed soul receives the names of turning need and fate."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c0f42aa81160c9dadc492a1cef5dd98f","tos.text-unit.sid-c0f42aa81160c9dadc492a1cef5dd98f"]},"form":"Nothdurft","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra-soul","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"need","neighbours":["bestowing-virtue","zarathustra","zarathustra-soul"],"line":{"ru":"Дарение спрашивается как нужда, принятие как милосердие.","en":"Giving is questioned as a need, receiving as mercy."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7bca57116e5b84b9ec79a8822fca4985","tos.text-unit.sid-7bca57116e5b84b9ec79a8822fca4985"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"need","neighbours":["creation","dance","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Творческий порыв заставляет случайности танцевать звёздный хоровод.","en":"Creative impulse makes chances dance a round of stars."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-633529a6d460ee90f4abca0f00d3789d","tos.text-unit.sid-633529a6d460ee90f4abca0f00d3789d"]},"form":"noththut","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["joy-lust","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Поиск приманки превращает мир в богатое море охотника.","en":"Seeking bait turns the world into the hunter’s rich sea."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0419ecf7cafbade69745f05d96aa7112","tos.text-unit.sid-f4adaee241ca545c330e205b41a2baa2"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"soothsayer","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["will","becoming","attention","laughter","zarathustra","soothsayer"],"line":{"ru":"Прорицатель заставляет учителя услышать крик человеческой нужды.","en":"The soothsayer makes the teacher hear the cry of human need."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d4fa93fc685ae9b33d2018be8bd798d7","tos.text-unit.sid-d4fa93fc685ae9b33d2018be8bd798d7"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"kings","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["kings"],"line":{"ru":"Короли ищут высшего человека как ответ собственной нужде.","en":"The kings seek the higher man as an answer to their need."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8eefc51c7cd2513b3fe3b658e61db026","tos.text-unit.sid-8eefc51c7cd2513b3fe3b658e61db026"]},"form":"Nothschrei","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["joy-lust","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель удерживает насмешку и покидает королей ради крика помощи.","en":"The teacher restrains mockery and leaves the kings for the cry of help."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.04","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5726cd6ed3e25077ae3a29b5119ce1a3","tos.text-unit.sid-5726cd6ed3e25077ae3a29b5119ce1a3"]},"form":"Nothschrei","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"conscientious","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["body-self","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Желание исправить собственную грубость прерывает новый крик нужды.","en":"A new cry of need interrupts the wish to repair one’s own roughness."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e4773abbfcbda81dd8e326c351fb37cf","tos.text-unit.sid-e4773abbfcbda81dd8e326c351fb37cf"]},"form":"Nothschrei","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["will","identity","counterfactual","circle","earth"],"line":{"ru":"Крик помощи приводит учителя к играющему страдание чародею.","en":"The cry for help brings the teacher to a magician performing suffering."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-87715c43b3000d89a7f968ebd943581b","tos.text-unit.sid-87715c43b3000d89a7f968ebd943581b"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"magician","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["magician"],"line":{"ru":"Чародей напоминает, как учитель поверил изображённому страданию.","en":"The magician recalls the teacher believing in performed suffering."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6cd24ce1fe2968a1838b36a2e6e868bc","tos.text-unit.sid-6cd24ce1fe2968a1838b36a2e6e868bc"]},"form":"Nothschrei","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"last-pope","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Гостеприимство папе уступает поспешному поиску страдающего.","en":"Hospitality to the pope yields to the urgent search for the suffering one."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3ae37eee5307bc533e112969700d2b11","tos.text-unit.sid-3ae37eee5307bc533e112969700d2b11"]},"form":"Nothleidende","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["will","bestowing-virtue"],"line":{"ru":"Поиск страдающего сопровождается благодарностью дарам дня.","en":"The search for the suffering one is accompanied by gratitude for the day’s gifts."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2dbac91b8672df5eec8f9f763c29cc0d","tos.text-unit.sid-2dbac91b8672df5eec8f9f763c29cc0d"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"ugliest-man","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["ugliest-man"],"line":{"ru":"Безобразный ищет защиту от вторгающегося сострадания.","en":"The ugly one seeks protection from intrusive compassion."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2a9db310a590f588d53cbe6a0a92a291","tos.text-unit.sid-2de89fe6f3c163a16fe443ab80d9cd67"]},"form":"Nothschrei","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"beggar","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Нищему предложены пещера, звери и мёд перед уходом учителя.","en":"The beggar is offered cave, animals and honey before the teacher leaves."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-251d3e1e961e759e21579013f7080236","tos.text-unit.sid-251d3e1e961e759e21579013f7080236"]},"form":"nothwendiger","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"necessity","neighbours":["fate","becoming","memory","agency"],"line":{"ru":"Сон забывает малую жажду, сохраняя открытый взгляд.","en":"Sleep forgets the little thirst while keeping the gaze open."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-cbca3c4a61fb282f2239ab51b47f8f88","tos.text-unit.sid-cbca3c4a61fb282f2239ab51b47f8f88"]},"form":"Nothschrei","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["great-noon","identity","difference","counterfactual","attention"],"line":{"ru":"Многоголосый крик открывает учителю собственную пещеру.","en":"The many-voiced cry reveals the teacher’s own cave to him."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-13c0e8904d055a5a0e8a133bfc933feb","tos.text-unit.sid-13c0e8904d055a5a0e8a133bfc933feb"]},"form":"Nothschrei","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["attention","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Смешанный крик раскрывается как нужда высших людей.","en":"The mixed cry reveals itself as the higher men’s need."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-41471577a6c96428be518ac3b434a7e5","tos.text-unit.sid-41471577a6c96428be518ac3b434a7e5"]},"form":"Nothschreienden","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Общее страдание требует присутствия, способного преобразить встречу.","en":"Shared suffering calls for a presence able to transform the encounter."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-272becc64198e2b33244618ffb679506","tos.text-unit.sid-272becc64198e2b33244618ffb679506"]},"form":"Nothschrein","speaker":"kings","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["courage","will","becoming","kings"],"line":{"ru":"Крик нужды сменяется открытостью и озорным мужеством.","en":"The cry of need gives way to openness and exuberant courage."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4d0f7408a6a794d4628d442bfbf3252b","tos.text-unit.sid-4d0f7408a6a794d4628d442bfbf3252b"]},"form":"nothwendiger","speaker":"soothsayer","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"necessity","neighbours":["fate","identity","difference","soothsayer"],"line":{"ru":"Звери отвечают учителю его формулой приоритета нужного.","en":"The animals answer the teacher with his formula of what is most needed."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1fb63faa24fd7fc1430721ea7faaac7d","tos.text-unit.sid-1fb63faa24fd7fc1430721ea7faaac7d"]},"form":"Nothstände","speaker":"soothsayer","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["body-self","soothsayer"],"line":{"ru":"Телесная нужда учителя получает простое имя голода.","en":"The teacher’s bodily need receives the plain name hunger."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-39bbc79dc14e690bed688203031625fe","tos.text-unit.sid-39bbc79dc14e690bed688203031625fe"]},"form":"nöthig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["overman","becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Лучшее сверхчеловека связывается с самым злым человеческим.","en":"The overman’s best is joined to the human’s worst."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b92d7d225af5cd602f68f0c5df7b6360","tos.text-unit.sid-b92d7d225af5cd602f68f0c5df7b6360"]},"form":"Nothschreiens","speaker":"shadow","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["will","innocence-play","shadow"],"line":{"ru":"Тень просит учителя остаться с ещё скрытым страданием гостей.","en":"The shadow asks the teacher to stay with the guests’ still-hidden suffering."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e4cf6fcb0765dd87eabae1722a3a491b","tos.text-unit.sid-e4cf6fcb0765dd87eabae1722a3a491b"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель спрашивает, куда исчезла нужда гостей.","en":"The teacher asks where the guests’ need has gone."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bbcdb5cd65db398f9004d45fce1b7719","tos.text-unit.sid-bbcdb5cd65db398f9004d45fce1b7719"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"need","neighbours":["becoming","agency","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заново расцветшим гостям предложены новые праздники.","en":"Freshly flowering guests are offered new festivals."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c0e3a3517b021107cee042466f68a20d","tos.text-unit.sid-c0e3a3517b021107cee042466f68a20d"]},"form":"Nothschrei","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"cry-of-need","neighbours":["affirmation","memory","attention","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Воспоминание собирает вчера и сегодня одним взглядом.","en":"Recollection gathers yesterday and today in one glance."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f78cd9708e12d8b3517955f4d98bf594","tos.text-unit.sid-f78cd9708e12d8b3517955f4d98bf594"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"need","neighbours":["affirmation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель узнаёт вчерашний крик как нужду высших людей.","en":"The teacher recognizes yesterday’s cry as the higher men’s need."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3d1354d943eaa862a767c3d14e5f0887","tos.text-unit.sid-3d1354d943eaa862a767c3d14e5f0887"]},"form":"Noth","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"need","neighbours":["will","zarathustra","soothsayer"],"line":{"ru":"Прорицатель вспоминается искусителем чужой нуждой.","en":"The soothsayer is recalled as a tempter through others’ distress."}}]}
